  "details": "When viewing a user's profile on the mobile app, then backing out of their profile, the \"By Locations\" tab does not refresh.\n\nApp version: 2026.1.1p2-1786-5b0ed6188d-Release\n\nRepro steps:\n\n1. Open VRChat on Mobile Android\n\n2. Do not launch the mobile client; stay on the app\n\n3. Click the Social tab on the bottom UI (between the Home and Play Icon)\n\n4. The Social tab will populate a list of friends By Location, as normal\n\n5. Click on any user\n\n5.a. You can additionally interact with the user profile, such as Booping, but the result of Step 7 will still be the same.\n\n6. Back out of their profile.\n\n7. The app will try to load the \"By Location\" Social tab again, but will hang, and refuse to load.\n\nExpected behavior:\n\nWhen backing out of the User Profile, the list of friends should populate within the By Location portion of the Social tab. If you back out of a user profile within the \"Online\" or \"Offline\" portion of the Social menu, it will still default to the By Location tab, and refuse to load.\n\nObservations:\n\n1. Clicking another tab at the bottom of the UI (such as Home or Search), then going back to the Social Menu will once again populate the list of friends By Location\n\n2. Clicking \"Online\" or \"Offline\", then going back to By Location will still refuse to load, unless you perform observation 1.\n\n3. Using 'swiping' inputs to switch between Online/Offline/By Location will still produce the same result as observation 2.",
